OL,3,GNEWSADing-dong over silencing of church
OL,4,Achimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA row has broken out after a
OL,7,FStaffordshire church's clock chimes
OL,8,Fwere silenced following a noise
OL,9,Fcomplaint.
OL,11,FSt Margaret's Church in Wolstanton said
OL,12,Fits clock had chimed since 30 September
OL,13,F1889 without any issue, except during
OL,14,Fthe two world wars and maintenance
OL,15,Fperiods.
OL,17,FHowever, they said it has been
OL,18,Finstructed to silence the clock
OL,19,Ffollowing a complaint from a local
OL,20,Fresident to Newcastle-under-Lyme
OL,21,FBorough Council.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
